sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Vue前端
    participant JWT as JwtAuthFilter
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant EC as EnrollmentController
    participant ES as EnrollmentService
    participant CS as CourseService
    participant SC as ScheduleController
    participant XC as ExamController
    participant XS as ExamService
    participant R as Redis/Redisson
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ

    Note over F,MQ: ===== 登录流程 =====
    F->>AC: POST /auth/login
    AC->>AS: login(username, password)
    AS->>DB: SELECT sys_user WHERE username=?
    DB-->>AS: user
    AS->>AS: BCrypt.matches(password)
    alt 密码错误
        AS->>DB: UPDATE login_fail_count+1
        alt fail_count>=5
            AS->>DB: UPDATE lock_until=NOW+30min
            AS-->>F: 10302 ACCOUNT_LOCKED
        end
        AS-->>F: 10301 PASSWORD_ERROR
    end
    AS->>DB: reset fail_count, update last_login_time
    AS->>AS: JwtTokenProvider.createToken(userId,roles)
    AS->>R: cache refreshToken
    AS-->>F: {accessToken, refreshToken, userInfo}

    Note over F,MQ: ===== 选课抢课流程 =====
    F->>JWT: Authorization: Bearer {token}
    JWT->>JWT: validate → userId=1001, roles=[STUDENT]
    F->>EC: POST /enrollments {offeringId: 5}
    EC->>ES: enroll(1001, 5)

    ES->>DB: 查询当前轮次是否开放
    alt 轮次未开放
        ES-->>F: 10002 ENROLL_TIME_NOT_OPEN
    end

    ES->>DB: 查询是否已选 (1001,5)
    alt 已选
        ES-->>F: 10006 DUPLICATE_ENROLL
    end

    ES->>DB: 查询已选门数 + 学分
    alt 超限
        ES-->>F: 10004 CREDIT_EXCEEDED
    end

    ES->>R: RLock("enroll:offering:5").lock()
    ES->>R: DECR "enroll:quota:5"
    R-->>ES: remaining=3 (≥0 ✓)

    ES->>DB: INSERT reg_enrollment (status=0)
    ES->>R: RLock.unlock()
    ES->>MQ: publish EnrollmentCreated

    ES-->>F: {code:200, data: enrollment}

    Note over MQ,DB: 异步同步
    MQ->>DB: UPDATE offering SET enrolled_count+1

    Note over F,MQ: ===== 课程广场 =====
    F->>CS: GET /courses/offerings?keyword=Java&page=1&size=20
    CS->>DB: SELECT ... FROM crs_offering WHERE status=1
    DB-->>CS: Page<Offering>
    CS-->>F: PageResult {total, records}

    Note over F,MQ: ===== 课表查询 =====
    F->>SC: GET /schedules/my
    SC->>DB: 判断角色 → 查询 reg_enrollment JOIN crs_offering
    DB-->>SC: List<ScheduleItem>
    SC-->>F: ScheduleVO {weekMap: {1:[...],2:[...]}}

    Note over F,MQ: ===== 考试提交 =====
    F->>XC: POST /exams/1/submit {answers}
    XC->>XS: submit(1001, 1, answers)
    XS->>DB: SELECT exam_record (1,1001)
    alt 已交卷
        XS-->>F: 10102 ALREADY_SUBMITTED
    end
    XS->>DB: SELECT exam (status, end_time)
    alt 超时
        XS-->>F: 10101 EXAM_ENDED
    end
    XS->>DB: SELECT questions WITH answers
    loop 客观题评分
        XS->>XS: 比对答案 → 累加分数
    end
    XS->>DB: UPDATE exam_record (submit, score, status=1)
    XS-->>F: ExamResultVO {objectiveScore, totalScore}
